<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $9.27 per cwt live, down 0.07 when compared to Monday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -    Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 5.11   89.50    -	 5.86</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   18.25   -0.50    0.22</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   15.50   -0.25    0.70</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  162.00    -	 0.42</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   65.00    -	 0.21</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   60.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  160.50   -6.50    0.26</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   25.00   -0.25    0.10</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   80.00    -	 0.09</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   40.00    -	 0.38</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   21.00    -	 0.14</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   38.00    -	 0.06</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  290.50   -4.50    0.54</p>
